    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"let go of the weight...\" i don't even know if i can. sometimes i look at the void outside the window and i just wonder if it would be easier to just... stop. to just let the silence take over instead of fighting it every single day. it feels like the only way to actually find some peace is to just not be here anymore.",
